    "name": "Permit To Work API",
    "description": "Integration tests for the Permit To Work API.\n\n**Before running:** start SQL Server (`docker compose up -d sqlserver`), apply migrations, and run the API (`dotnet run --project src/PermitToWork.Api`).\n\n**Postman must be told to accept the local development certificate:** Settings -> General -> SSL certificate verification -> off. Otherwise every request fails with a self-signed certificate error.\n\nRun the whole collection with the Collection Runner, top to bottom. Requests share state through collection variables, so order matters.",
